flowchart LR
    U[Judge / User] --> UI[DarkShop React demo site\nStart Inspection]
    UI --> API[Live inspection stream\n/api/inspection/stream]
    API --> B[Playwright + Chromium\ncontrolled browser]
    B --> D[DOM + visible text\nselectors + bounding boxes]
    B --> S[Interactive state\nchecked / visible / enabled]
    B --> P[Full-page screenshots\nproduct / checkout / subscription]
    D --> R[Evidence rules\noptional + preselected\nscarcity/timer\nprice-flow signals]
    S --> R
    R --> E[Evidence package\nscan.json + response.json\nDOM files + PNGs]
    E --> DET[Detection layer\ncurrent prototype: deterministic rules\nfuture: annotated NLP model]
    DET --> F[Candidate finding\npattern + confidence + evidence]
    F --> BE[Backend integration\nAPI + risk + compliance + storage]
    BE --> OUT[Results dashboard\npattern cards + screenshot\nselector + ethical fix]
    OUT --> U

    CPPA[External ground truth\nCPPA/CPRA principles\nclear, balanced choices] -. guides rules .-> R
    CLEAN[Clean page control\nexpected zero findings] -. validates false positives .-> DET

    classDef ui fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#4f46e5,color:#111827
    classDef scan fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#111827
    classDef evidence fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#d97706,color:#111827
    classDef detect fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,color:#111827
    classDef backend fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#111827
    classDef control fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#111827
    class UI,API ui
    class B,D,S,P scan
    class R,E evidence
    class DET,F detect
    class BE,OUT backend
    class CPPA,CLEAN control
